Comb floor
  L(S) >= (6/7) mu12 - b*r12/(7V)
  positivity threshold V/b > r12/(6 mu12) = 388080/6617 = 58.648935

Sheet-count floor
  For fixed u in G_12, the offsets frac(V*n/b) are a b-point grid.
  A danger interval of length 1/7 kills at most b/7+1 sheets.
  Hence safe sheets >= 6b/7 - 1, and
  L(S) >= mu12 * (6/7 - 1/b).

